Third-party material

- The keyframe apply engine: the functions between the "vendored" markers in src/apply.js, and
  the pinned copy they are checked against, vendor/EasePresets.v0.24.1.jsx. From EffectCraft's
  bundled panel "Ease Presets.jsx" (extensions/scriptui-panels/Ease Presets.jsx, tag v0.24.1,
  https://github.com/storytold/effectcraft). Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the EffectCraft
  contributors. MIT OR Apache-2.0. One change: the name of the undo step.

- The 24 easing curves in src/core.js: the cubic-bezier values of Robert Penner's easing
  functions as listed by easings.net and published in postcss-easings
  (https://github.com/postcss/postcss-easings, Copyright 2015 Andrey Sitnik, MIT). All 24 were
  compared with that list.

- tools/fonts/Inter-Regular.ttf: Inter, Copyright (c) 2016 The Inter Project Authors
  (https://github.com/rsms/inter), SIL Open Font License 1.1 (tools/fonts/OFL-Inter.txt). The
  file EffectCraft embeds as its UI font, unmodified. Used only by the development tool
  tools/render.py. It is not part of the panel and not in the release download. The character
  widths in src/ui.js (GLYPH_W) are measurements of this font.
